# RTK fixture matrix. One row per fixture folder. Read by tests/wx-wrapper.test.sh and benchmarks/run-rtk-benchmark.sh.
# fixture      group   kind   fake   real   real_evidence
#   group: A built-in tools, B code diagnostics, C search/list/history, D generic log, X demoted (command is recognized-only; the fixture proves it stays raw)
#   kind: success | evidence (warning or evidence-like output) | nonzero | empty | informational (not a plain run)
#   fake: outcome with tests/fixtures/bin/rtk.  real: outcome pinned for RTK 0.42.4.
#   outcome: recognized (group X: class recognized-only, RTK not called) | accepted (RTK output shown) | guard (evidence-guard fallback) | smaller (rtk-not-smaller fallback)
#            rtk-empty (rtk-empty-output fallback) | nonzero (failing run, RTK not called) | empty (no stdout, RTK not called)
#   real_evidence: yes | no (known loss: RTK output was shown and the markers file has text that is missing) | n/a (no markers)
#   Markers: the text in <fixture>/markers (one string per line) is evidence that must stay visible in the stdout.
